    "description": "Noble house, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 553 blocks vs 420 (first build 442 vs 310). A stone and timber manor, its long side to the street: stone ground course, white plaster in a dark oak frame, a spruce gable roof with half-timbered gables, a front cross gable and a back dormer, a brick chimney on the left gable. Inside: hall, study, dining table and kitchen below, three bedrooms under the roof (staircase, side door to the garden). L2 a balcony on stone brick porch columns, lanterns, shutters, flower boxes, banners, bookshelves and a lectern, garden flowers and lantern posts; L3 a walled garden with lantern pillars and an obelisk, bushes, pots, candles, carpets, vines. Not yet builder-tested: allium, azure_bluet, bookshelf, brick_stairs, cornflower, dandelion, dark_oak_fence, dark_oak_slab, lectern, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern.",
